 "title": "Rational points",
 "statement": "Let $k$ be a field and $X$ a scheme over $k$. A *$k$-rational\npoint* of $X$ is a section $\\sigma:\\operatorname{Spec}(k)\\to X$ of the structure\nmorphism; for a scheme $T$ over $k$ the induced section is\n$\\sigma_T:T\\to X_T$ ([def-pc-base-change]).",
